# HMOG continuous-authentication revision

This directory contains the manuscript revision prompted by the three reviewer
reports. The canonical artifacts are:

- `hmog_revised_experiment.py` -- corrected end-to-end experiment;
- `METHODOLOGY_AUDIT.md` -- defects found in the earlier code and their fixes;
- `main_paper.tex` -- canonical manuscript synchronized with the revised method;
- `legacy/main_paper_original.*` -- preserved pre-audit manuscript and PDF;
- `RESPONSE_TO_REVIEWERS.md` -- point-by-point response draft;
- `revised_results/` -- preprocessing quality log, fold manifest, numerical
  results, metadata, and the drift figure.

Run the experiment with:

```text
MPLCONFIGDIR=/private/tmp/q1-mpl \
  /opt/anaconda3/bin/python3 hmog_revised_experiment.py
```

Compile the revised paper with:

```text
latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode main_paper.tex
```

## Important

The old `hmog_baseline.py`, `hmog_lstm_light.py`, `hmog_cache_probas.py`,
`hmog_analysis*.py`, old CSV files, and old PNG figures are legacy records.
They contain results affected by methodology errors, including HMOG metadata
being parsed as sensor axes. They must not be cited or copied into the revised
paper.

The HMOG ZIP files are expected at `~/Downloads/public_dataset` unless a
different path is passed with `--data-dir`.
